        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a. General Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Soccer Online is a fast-paced multiplayer street soccer game that captures the energy and fun of the sport. With no rules to hold you back, this game delivers a pure, exhilarating soccer experience. Play as both a player and a goalkeeper, and immerse yourself in the spirit of street soccer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.poster.avif?t=1782140022\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.webm?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.mp4?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>b. Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rules Soccer:</strong> Feel the freedom and dynamism of street soccer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Both Player and Goalkeeper:</strong> Show your skills in every position on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Fun:</strong> Simple controls make it easy to play, but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Maps: Various maps are coming soon as the game continues to evolve!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes: Ball growth mode and ball rain mode available (New game modes coming soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Create strategies with realistic football movements and collisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.poster.avif?t=1782140022\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.webm?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.mp4?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>c. Game Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Street Soccer Online, the goal is simple: score goals, outplay your opponents, and have fun! Players can dribble, shoot, and tackle on the field or block shots as a goalkeeper. Matches are short and fast-paced, maximizing the excitement and fun factor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.poster.avif?t=1782140022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.webm?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.mp4?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>d. Developer’s Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;One Developer, One Big Dream&quot;</strong><br>Street Soccer Online is a project built entirely by a solo developer. Capturing the essence of street soccer and sharing it with players has been my ultimate goal. I am committed to improving the game with your feedback and taking it to the next level. Your support on this journey means everything to me!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>a. General Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Soccer Online is a fast-paced multiplayer street soccer game that captures the energy and fun of the sport. With no rules to hold you back, this game delivers a pure, exhilarating soccer experience. Play as both a player and a goalkeeper, and immerse yourself in the spirit of street soccer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.poster.avif?t=1782140022\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.webm?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/39d1f01a7791bb9cbd4a82568987f546.mp4?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>b. Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rules Soccer:</strong> Feel the freedom and dynamism of street soccer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Both Player and Goalkeeper:</strong> Show your skills in every position on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Fun:</strong> Simple controls make it easy to play, but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Maps: Various maps are coming soon as the game continues to evolve!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes: Ball growth mode and ball rain mode available (New game modes coming soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Create strategies with realistic football movements and collisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.poster.avif?t=1782140022\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.webm?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/cf0ebb320f18f7c2b50001505511ba24.mp4?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>c. Game Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Street Soccer Online, the goal is simple: score goals, outplay your opponents, and have fun! Players can dribble, shoot, and tackle on the field or block shots as a goalkeeper. Matches are short and fast-paced, maximizing the excitement and fun factor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.poster.avif?t=1782140022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.webm?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/d57ca89344023f1235b4663ec5a116fb.mp4?t=1782140022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>d. Developer’s Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;One Developer, One Big Dream&quot;</strong><br>Street Soccer Online is a project built entirely by a solo developer. Capturing the essence of street soccer and sharing it with players has been my ultimate goal. I am committed to improving the game with your feedback and taking it to the next level. Your support on this journey means everything to me!</p>",
        "short_description": "Street Soccer Online: Dive into chaotic, rule-free multiplayer street football! Master realistic dribbles, unleash epic shots, and switch between striker and goalie to outplay friends online. No refs, just pure adrenaline – wishlist now and claim the streets!",
